    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_mai_shna_chakak",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מאי שנא התם דאמרת פחות מארבע אמות, ומאי שנא הכא דאמרת פחות משלשה טפחים?",
     "against": "p_chakak_kasher",
     "state": "answered"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Sukkah.4b.3",
   "sugya": "sukkah_3b_miut_vekundeisin",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_itei_ledofen",
     "gloss_en": "התם, דאיתיה לדופן -- פחות מארבע אמות סגיא; הכא, לשוויי לדופן -- פחות משלשה טפחים אין, אי לא לא: there the wall exists; here the pit's edge must be made into the wall (by lavud)",
     "answers": "obj_mai_shna_chakak",
     "restores": "p_chakak_kasher"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Sukkah.4b.5",
   "sugya": "sukkah_3b_miut_vekundeisin",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_nikarot",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אמר ליה רבא: בעינן מחיצות הניכרות, וליכא",
     "against": "p_abaye_amud",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rava_nikarot",
     "gloss_en": "Rava: we require conspicuous partitions, and there are none"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Sukkah.4b.11",
   "sugya": "sukkah_3b_miut_vekundeisin",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_bitarti",
     "kind": "meitivi",
     "gloss_en": "ועוד: באמצע הוא דפליגי, אבל על שפת הגג דברי הכל כשרה! לימא תיהוי תיובתיה דרב הונא בתרתי -- the baraita sets the dispute in mid-roof (the ground), implying all agree at the edge",
     "against": "p_huna_sfat_hagag",
     "state": "answered"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Sukkah.4b.12",
   "sugya": "sukkah_3b_miut_vekundeisin",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_lehodiacha_kocho",
     "gloss_en": "אמר לך רב הונא (the Gemara on his behalf): פליגי באמצע הגג, והוא הדין על שפת הגג; and they dispute mid-roof להודיעך כחו דרבי יעקב, that he validates even there",
     "answers": "obj_bitarti",
     "restores": "p_huna_sfat_hagag"
    }
   ]
  },
  "0": {
   "segId": "Sukkah.4b.1",
